<section id="story" class="reveal"><div class="eyebrow">Our Story</div><h2>A little taste of everything</h2><p style="max-width:680px;font-size:18px;color:var(--brown)">Latapata began with a simple idea: a table where a masala tea, a wood-fired pizza and a warm waffle can share the same afternoon. We cook fresh, serve warmly, and keep the menu as curious as our guests. <span class="demo">Story text is placeholder — replace with the cafe's own.</span></p></section>
